00:11:12,120 --> 00:11:13,120
You weren't kidding.

288
00:11:13,120 --> 00:11:15,600
Told you so? It hypes you up, huh?

289
00:11:15,980 --> 00:11:19,000
I love it here. Just looking around gives me a rush.

290
00:11:19,480 --> 00:11:20,740
Yeah, I get that.

291
00:11:22,480 --> 00:11:27,640
It really is amazing. So many different styles. In every color imaginable.

292
00:11:30,460 --> 00:11:32,880
They're all so... beautiful.

293
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:34,600
Gojo!

294
00:11:35,600 --> 00:11:37,840
I found it. Medium black.

295
00:11:38,700 --> 00:11:39,300
Black?

296
00:11:39,700 --> 00:11:42,900
Yep. This one's styled just like hers. It's perfect.

297
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:46,920
The style's great, but I think we should do this color.

298
00:11:47,160 --> 00:11:50,360
Huh? That one? Why? It looks kind of purple.

299
00:11:50,740 --> 00:11:54,840
Sure. But I think Shizuku-tan's character color is purple, isn't it?

300
00:11:55,500 --> 00:11:58,760
I mean, her hair is black, but it looks like it has some depth to it.

301
00:11:58,900 --> 00:12:00,220
Plus, a purple tint feels more her.

302
00:12:00,980 --> 00:12:02,660
Oh, good call.

303
00:12:03,200 --> 00:12:05,960
For such a big fan, she doesn't pay much attention to details.

304
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:09,020
I think we should go with this black violet.

305
00:12:09,360 --> 00:12:11,400
Or wait, maybe the deep violet instead.

306
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:17,160
Also, the length's wrong. We need to get one that's longer.

307
00:12:17,640 --> 00:12:18,340
But why?

308
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:22,220
Shizuku-tan has an asymmetrical bob, so just a medium length won't work.

309
00:12:22,360 --> 00:12:24,400
If we buy it longer, we can trim it for accuracy.

310
00:12:24,780 --> 00:12:26,880
Oh, yeah! I'll get it cut at my salon!

311
00:12:27,580 --> 00:12:29,920
Wait, by a real stylist? That's perfect!

312
00:12:30,220 --> 00:12:31,320
Bobs are super hard to cut.

313
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:33,580
I'm glad you're here.

314
00:12:34,140 --> 00:12:36,500
I was planning on doing all this alone today.

315
00:12:37,020 --> 00:12:37,360
What?

316
00:12:37,860 --> 00:12:40,120
But every time I do that, it's a mess.

317
00:12:40,460 --> 00:12:42,640
I always pick out the most inaccurate pieces.

318
00:12:43,200 --> 00:12:44,320
We would have been in big trouble.

319
00:12:45,740 --> 00:12:47,520
You saved me so much time.

320
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:48,800
And money, too.

321
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:51,100
Thank you.

322
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:55,100
All right, I'm gonna go buy this.

323
00:12:55,780 --> 00:12:56,100
Okay.

324
00:12:59,020 --> 00:12:59,500
Unbelievable.

325
00:13:00,500 --> 00:13:02,260
I guess that means...

326
00:13:02,260 --> 00:13:04,100
Maybe today...

327
00:13:04,100 --> 00:13:05,380
I was actually useful.

328
00:13:08,760 --> 00:13:09,780
Sorry for the wait.

329
00:13:10,260 --> 00:13:12,060
I got some color contacts, too.

330
00:13:12,480 --> 00:13:13,780
Here, I'll hold that for you.

331
00:13:13,920 --> 00:13:15,040
Oh, sweet. Thanks.

332
00:13:15,800 --> 00:13:17,200
One more stop to go.

333
00:13:17,200 --> 00:13:22,440
She needs her garters and stockings.

334
00:13:23,740 --> 00:13:26,460
Let me know if I can help you.

335
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:27,980
Hey, Kitagawa?

336
00:13:28,460 --> 00:13:30,560
How much longer do you think it'll be before we go?

337
00:13:31,560 --> 00:13:32,740
Not much longer.

338
00:13:33,320 --> 00:13:34,840
Hey, it's just...

339
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:36,520
I don't know if I'm allowed in here.

340
00:13:36,900 --> 00:13:38,060
Um, because I'm a guy.

341
00:13:38,540 --> 00:13:40,740
Yeah, I know you are, Doofus.

342
00:13:41,120 --> 00:13:41,700
I know you do.

343
00:13:42,260 --> 00:13:45,400
I'm just worried that other customers might not be comfortable with me here.

344
00:13:45,400 --> 00:13:47,160
Couples come in together all the time.

345
00:13:47,340 --> 00:13:47,920
You're fine.

346
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:54,460
This is so incredibly awkward.

347
00:13:54,820 --> 00:13:56,420
Hurry up, Kitagawa, please.

348
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:58,480
Gojo, check it out.

349
00:13:59,800 --> 00:14:00,720
What do you think?

350
00:14:01,060 --> 00:14:02,240
Doesn't this look hot?

351
00:14:04,500 --> 00:14:04,900
Yikes!

352
00:14:05,100 --> 00:14:06,280
I can see everything down there.

353
00:14:06,360 --> 00:14:06,860
Cover up!

354
00:14:06,860 --> 00:14:11,420
Actually, I was hoping to find a way to thank you for today, somehow.

355
00:14:12,420 --> 00:14:14,220
Would you like something sexier?

356
00:14:16,220 --> 00:14:16,700
Please!

357
00:14:16,880 --> 00:14:17,760
Just let me go home!

358
00:14:17,780 --> 00:14:18,660
I can't take it!

359
00:14:18,820 --> 00:14:20,180
Andy's a screamer!

360
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:21,100
Everything was great!

361
00:14:21,140 --> 00:14:21,940
Thanks a ton, man!

362
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:22,640
Come back soon!

363
00:14:23,000 --> 00:14:23,380
Yum!

364
00:14:23,640 --> 00:14:24,620
That was so good!

365
00:14:25,200 --> 00:14:25,720
Agreed.

366
00:14:25,960 --> 00:14:26,760
It was delicious.

367
00:14:27,800 --> 00:14:28,900
Teenagers on a date.

368
00:14:29,560 --> 00:14:30,880
That sure takes me back.

369
00:14:30,880 --> 00:14:32,760
I miss those days.

370
00:14:33,400 --> 00:14:34,640
Adulting ruins lives.

371
00:14:36,140 --> 00:14:37,240
Okay, moment of truth.

372
00:14:37,660 --> 00:14:39,320
What did you think of Slippery Girls?

373
00:14:39,860 --> 00:14:41,520
Honestly, I haven't finished it yet.

374
00:14:41,780 --> 00:14:42,840
What part are you on?

375
00:14:42,980 --> 00:14:46,660
The one where he's up in front of the whole school at the morning assembly and can't stop ejaculating?

376
00:14:46,860 --> 00:14:47,780
I can't even imagine that.

377
00:14:47,780 --> 00:14:49,060
What in the actual hell?

378
00:14:49,700 --> 00:14:51,360
I know I was panicking for him.

379
00:14:51,460 --> 00:14:52,700
Poor guy just couldn't stop.

380
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:54,560
Does she think that's funny or something?

381
00:14:54,660 --> 00:14:55,720
What's going on with his body?

382
00:14:56,300 --> 00:14:58,780
Our future is in their sick little hands.

383
00:14:59,120 --> 00:14:59,560
Terrifying.

384
00:14:59,560 --> 00:15:03,700
If you want, I can take all this back to my place.

385
00:15:04,020 --> 00:15:04,780
Sounds good.

386
00:15:05,120 --> 00:15:06,860
I'll get the pattern drawn up for you, too.

387
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:07,860
For real?

388
00:15:08,280 --> 00:15:08,860
Hell yeah!

389
00:15:10,100 --> 00:15:12,460
Where's the first place I should wear it once it's complete?

390
00:15:12,760 --> 00:15:14,220
Are there designated areas?

391
00:15:14,940 --> 00:15:18,320
There are all kinds of events where cosplay groups get their photos taken.

392
00:15:19,260 --> 00:15:22,300
Like they'll rent out amusement parks for super creative shoots.

393
00:15:22,680 --> 00:15:26,500
Those who aren't as extra might go to a studio or even just cosplay at home.

394
00:15:26,940 --> 00:15:29,320
I totes want to do some blingy photo booth shots, too.

395
00:15:29,900 --> 00:15:33,100
Basically, you're only limited by your own creativity.

396
00:15:34,020 --> 00:15:34,420
Fascinating.

397
00:15:35,100 --> 00:15:38,200
Oh, and of course, you can always post your favorites to your social meets.

398
00:15:38,660 --> 00:15:38,920
What?

399
00:15:39,240 --> 00:15:40,660
You put those photos on the internet?

400
00:15:41,020 --> 00:15:41,700
Uh, duh.

401
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:42,620
Why not?

402
00:15:42,820 --> 00:15:43,080
Look.

403
00:15:43,880 --> 00:15:44,740
That's amazing.

404
00:15:45,400 --> 00:15:47,380
I can't tell if she got that done at a studio.

405
00:15:47,780 --> 00:15:48,940
I love the details.

406
00:15:49,200 --> 00:15:51,240
Do you think she crafted her own props?

407
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:52,480
She probably bought them.

408
00:15:52,960 --> 00:15:54,120
Oh, look at this one!

409
00:15:54,380 --> 00:15:55,380
Her name is Juju.

410
00:15:55,800 --> 00:15:57,420
Isn't she offensively cute?

411
00:15:57,560 --> 00:15:58,960
I'm basically obsessed with her.

412
00:15:58,960 --> 00:16:02,860
She cosplays a lot of younger anime characters, like magical girls and stuff.

413
00:16:03,100 --> 00:16:06,480
She's gorgeous, and the quality of her costumes and photos are sick!

414
00:16:06,740 --> 00:16:08,520
That's why she's got like a gazillion followers.

415
00:16:09,100 --> 00:16:12,560
Apparently, she doesn't go to events, so she's like this eternal mystery.

416
00:16:12,800 --> 00:16:14,420
But I'm pretty sure she's a total pro.

417
00:16:15,100 --> 00:16:15,460
Wow.

418
00:16:15,760 --> 00:16:17,120
She looks really young, though.

419
00:16:17,660 --> 00:16:18,840
How old do you think she is?

420
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:19,920
Hmm.

421
00:16:20,280 --> 00:16:22,920
She might be in middle school, or at the end of grade school.

422
00:16:23,040 --> 00:16:23,280
Huh?

423
00:16:24,200 --> 00:16:25,220
Oh my gosh, look!

424
00:16:25,460 --> 00:16:29,200
She's cosplaying pre-transformation Shion Akairo from Flower Princess Blaze!

425
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:30,420
Her outfit is perfect!

426
00:16:30,560 --> 00:16:31,660
She's so freaking cute!

427
00:16:31,680 --> 00:16:33,260
I could literally throw up and die!

428
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:34,040
There's a theme.

429
00:16:34,760 --> 00:16:35,380
Black hair.

430
00:16:35,640 --> 00:16:36,580
It's a thing for you.

431
00:16:37,040 --> 00:16:38,540
And what about you, Kettle?

432
00:16:39,080 --> 00:16:40,180
Oh, right.

433
00:16:40,300 --> 00:16:40,860
Good point there.

434
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:43,160
Guess we're the same.

435
00:16:45,740 --> 00:16:47,060
You gotta see this!

436
00:16:47,060 --> 00:16:48,300
They're so pretty!

437
00:16:48,300 --> 00:16:51,180
Wow, this one's effing gorgeous!

438
00:16:51,740 --> 00:16:53,920
I swear girls who cosplay guys are my jam!

439
00:16:54,440 --> 00:16:54,800
Damn!

440
00:16:55,300 --> 00:16:56,900
Look how hot this one is!

441
00:16:58,720 --> 00:17:00,300
Why are you mute all of a sudden?

442
00:17:00,760 --> 00:17:02,500
Are you immune to beauty or something?

443
00:17:03,060 --> 00:17:03,340
What?

444
00:17:03,600 --> 00:17:04,280
No, I swear.

445
00:17:04,400 --> 00:17:05,120
Nothing like that.

446
00:17:05,620 --> 00:17:06,720
Then what is it?

447
00:17:06,980 --> 00:17:09,300
Well, um...

448
00:17:09,300 --> 00:17:11,480
It just made me think of something else from my childhood.

449
00:17:11,480 --> 00:17:18,660
I don't have any siblings.

450
00:17:19,500 --> 00:17:23,320
So the first time I ever saw a doll was on the shelf at my grandpa's store.

451
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:31,840
Huh?

452
00:17:31,840 --> 00:17:40,640
I couldn't take my eyes off of her.

453
00:17:40,640 --> 00:17:47,220
I thought to myself, how can something so beautiful exist in this world?

454
00:17:47,220 --> 00:17:59,060
It was like she reached in and stole my heart.

455
00:18:00,740 --> 00:18:06,640
There, in that moment, I first understood what the word beautiful meant.

456
00:18:07,520 --> 00:18:09,020
Nothing else could describe her.

457
00:18:09,020 --> 00:18:15,420
And no other word since then could be used to define things that are the most precious to me.

458
00:18:17,720 --> 00:18:21,800
So I don't say beautiful or pretty, unless it comes from the heart.

459
00:18:21,800 --> 00:18:28,080
Okay, but like, Hina dolls are all painted to look super gorgeous, right?

460
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:30,620
Gojo, you're a total face guy.

461
00:18:31,020 --> 00:18:32,520
I hope I didn't say something wrong.

462
00:18:33,160 --> 00:18:33,660
I'm sorry.

463
00:18:34,840 --> 00:18:36,860
I have a hard time giving compliments.

464
00:18:37,820 --> 00:18:41,800
I mean, it's not like I'm denying that those people look good, but...

465
00:18:41,800 --> 00:18:45,120
Dude, if that's your coat or whatever, it's totally fine to own it.

466
00:18:45,120 --> 00:18:51,500
Hey, it's okay not to compromise on stuff.

467
00:18:51,760 --> 00:18:53,920
I've got some things I'm pretty hardcore about, too.

468
00:18:54,560 --> 00:18:56,420
Like boob bags, for instance?

469
00:18:56,880 --> 00:18:57,260
Yep.

470
00:18:59,020 --> 00:18:59,980
Oh, baby!

471
00:19:00,320 --> 00:19:02,180
I gotta get that in my mouth!

472
00:19:03,260 --> 00:19:04,920
It looks so good!

473
00:19:05,400 --> 00:19:07,420
You sure you don't want me to get you on Gojo?

474
00:19:07,640 --> 00:19:08,960
Because I'll totes cover you.

475
00:19:09,120 --> 00:19:09,620
I'm sure.

476
00:19:09,940 --> 00:19:10,460
Thanks, though.

477
00:19:10,860 --> 00:19:12,140
Okay, be right back!

478
00:19:12,140 --> 00:19:12,700
Huh?

479
00:19:15,120 --> 00:19:20,080
How can she eat anything after we just had all that ramen?

480
00:19:20,460 --> 00:19:22,700
Damn, I went on a spending binge today.

481
00:19:23,100 --> 00:19:24,880
I'll have to add more hours at work.

482
00:19:25,080 --> 00:19:25,360
Wait!

483
00:19:25,640 --> 00:19:27,120
I forgot to pay you back for the ramen.

484
00:19:27,560 --> 00:19:27,840
What?

485
00:19:27,980 --> 00:19:29,200
I told you that was on me.

486
00:19:29,520 --> 00:19:30,780
I stole your whole day.

487
00:19:30,960 --> 00:19:31,640
If you're sure.

488
00:19:38,380 --> 00:19:39,880
I promise it's fine.

489
00:19:42,880 --> 00:19:44,880
It's just that...

490
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:46,780
It made me really happy.

491
00:19:48,220 --> 00:19:52,040
It's not very often that someone actually plays a game I recommend, you know?

492
00:19:52,540 --> 00:19:53,620
Most people will say,

493
00:19:53,960 --> 00:19:54,940
Yeah, that seems fun.

494
00:19:55,180 --> 00:19:57,020
And then awkwardly change the subject.

495
00:19:58,180 --> 00:19:59,620
To be completely honest,

496
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:03,140
I didn't think you'd be the type to get into a game like Slippery Girls.

497
00:20:03,660 --> 00:20:04,220
My bad.

498
00:20:05,220 --> 00:20:05,720
I mean,

499
00:20:06,020 --> 00:20:08,240
you're the one who drew her outfit perfectly,

500
00:20:08,360 --> 00:20:10,000
right down to the very last detail.

501
00:20:10,000 --> 00:20:11,420
It's hard to admit,

502
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:13,280
but you're more of an expert on it than me.

503
00:20:14,780 --> 00:20:15,800
And, um,

504
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:17,340
I have a point.

505
00:20:17,340 --> 00:20:22,260
I appreciate you.

506
00:20:22,600 --> 00:20:22,920
Okay?

507
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:27,060
Thank you, Gojo.

508
00:20:33,800 --> 00:20:34,240
Besides,

509
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:35,580
since I can't really sew,

510
00:20:35,680 --> 00:20:38,040
the only way I can help is by emptying my wallet.

511
00:20:38,300 --> 00:20:38,580
Right?

512
00:20:39,580 --> 00:20:39,980
No,

513
00:20:40,260 --> 00:20:41,340
that's not true.

514
00:20:41,480 --> 00:20:41,780
Anyway,

515
00:20:41,900 --> 00:20:43,720
this meat roll is giving me life right now.

516
00:20:44,220 --> 00:20:44,500
Here,

517
00:20:44,580 --> 00:20:44,980
have a bite.

518
00:20:45,060 --> 00:20:46,220
It'll blow your mind.

519
00:20:47,100 --> 00:20:47,540
Open.

520
00:20:48,040 --> 00:20:48,420
Here.

521
00:20:49,700 --> 00:20:50,140
No,

522
00:20:50,300 --> 00:20:51,400
that's an indirect kiss.

523
00:20:51,680 --> 00:20:51,960
Oh, no.

524
00:20:52,120 --> 00:20:53,440
I really couldn't eat another bite.

525
00:20:53,520 --> 00:20:54,960
You've treated me to more than enough today.

526
00:20:55,100 --> 00:20:55,760
I'm super stuffed.

527
00:20:56,020 --> 00:20:56,460
Okay.

528
00:20:57,180 --> 00:20:57,500
Please,

529
00:20:57,560 --> 00:20:58,100
don't be upset.

530
00:20:58,780 --> 00:20:59,320
I'm not,

531
00:20:59,420 --> 00:21:00,380
but you're missing out.

532
00:21:00,380 --> 00:21:01,060
Oh,

533
00:21:01,060 --> 00:21:01,100
no.

534
00:21:03,100 --> 00:21:03,580
Hmm?

535
00:21:07,140 --> 00:21:07,880
Oh, no.

536
00:21:08,240 --> 00:21:09,900
You'll probably think I'm a total pig,

537
00:21:09,980 --> 00:21:10,360
don't you?

538
00:21:10,780 --> 00:21:11,180
Huh.

539
00:21:14,300 --> 00:21:14,740
No,

540
00:21:14,920 --> 00:21:15,580
not at all.

541
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:16,360
Liar!

542
00:21:16,780 --> 00:21:17,220
Look,

543
00:21:17,360 --> 00:21:19,220
I'm not gonna get fat for eating like this,

544
00:21:19,240 --> 00:21:19,520
okay?

545
00:21:19,820 --> 00:21:21,720
Quit staring at me with that tone of voice.

546
00:21:21,840 --> 00:21:22,400
I'm fine!

547
00:21:22,600 --> 00:21:23,420
Of course you're fine.

548
00:21:23,540 --> 00:21:24,440
I wasn't judging you.

549
00:21:24,600 --> 00:21:24,940
I swear.

550
00:21:25,120 --> 00:21:25,980
My body needs carbs,

551
00:21:26,060 --> 00:21:26,360
okay?

552
00:21:26,620 --> 00:21:27,860
It's not my fault.

553
00:21:28,000 --> 00:21:28,700
It's science!

554
00:21:28,800 --> 00:21:29,220
Oh, yeah.

555
00:21:29,320 --> 00:21:29,880
I hear you.

556
00:21:30,380 --> 00:21:30,820
Whatever.

557
00:21:31,300 --> 00:21:33,120
I'm not eating anything until the event.

558
00:21:33,400 --> 00:21:35,620
I promise I'll still be able to fit into my cosplay.

559
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:36,920
You have to eat.

560
00:21:37,220 --> 00:21:38,980
But when does this event take place?

561
00:21:39,400 --> 00:21:39,540
Hmm?

562
00:21:39,880 --> 00:21:40,360
Hmm.

563
00:21:40,520 --> 00:21:41,160
